# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Fixes stale/incorrectly-cased links that were indexed before the site
# standardized on lowercase filenames (index.html, contact.html, etc.)

# Enforce / as the single canonical homepage URL (matches the canonical
# tag in index.html) instead of leaving /index.html separately crawlable
/index.html      /                 301
/Index.html      /                 301
/INDEX.HTML      /                 301
/Contact.html    /contact.html    301
/CONTACT.HTML    /contact.html    301
/About.html      /about.html      301
/Files.html      /files.html      301
/Blog.html       /blog.html       301

# The original 3 Jekyll-era blog posts no longer exist as static files
# (blog moved to Contentful, served via post.html?id=...). These were
# indexed by Google with real content, so redirect rather than 404.
/sop-manufacturing.html    /blog.html    301
/ifrs16-leases.html        /blog.html    301
/tax-theory-practice.html  /blog.html    301
